Dear CEOs

Hello

This update mainly fixes the following issues:

1. Fix the problem of sound and picture being out of sync;

2. Fix the problem of node option button popping up early;

3. Optimize the problem that the full screen game cannot be displayed on the desktop;

Added content in this update:

1. Add Thai and Indonesian support;

The above is all the content updated in this version. Welcome all players to experience it. We look forward to communicating with you at any time. Your support is our greatest motivation. Thank you very much!

————"CEO" technical team presents

Dear CEOs:

Hello, thank you for your company and support!

This update mainly repairs and optimizes the following issues:

1. Some computers have stuttering problems;

2. Video fast forward and rewind stuttering problems;

3. Black screen problems on a few computers;

4. Add support for Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean and Vietnamese;

The above is all the content updated in this version. Welcome all players to experience it. We are very happy for you to join our Q group 772576410. We look forward to communicating with you at any time. Your support is our greatest motivation. Thank you very much!

——The "CEO" technical team presents

Dear players:

Hello! Thank you for your love and support! Thank you for your valuable suggestions.

Recently, we have received feedback from some players about the problem of stuttering. Our technicians are currently urgently repairing it and will make major updates later.

The next update content is as follows:
1. Stuttering during play, fast forward and rewind;
2. Achievement and photo unlock prompts;
3. English subtitle version;

Before updating, you can try to solve the stuttering problem in the following ways:
1. Save the game in the solid-state drive;
2. Exit the game and re-enter it;
3. If the computer is connected to the TV externally, switch to the computer monitor;
4. Modify the monitor refresh rate, display settings -> advanced display settings -> select refresh rate, try to adjust the refresh rate;
5. Update the graphics card driver;

[h3]The discount period is about to end. If you like our game, you can buy it first. If you encounter game problems, you can join the official Q group 772576410 to find customer service staff for one-on-one solutions.[/h3]

We are very eager to have long-term communication with our players, so please feel free to join our Q communication group 772576410, we are happy to listen to your opinions and feedback.
